1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,752
Which one is a fly? Me! I'm a firefly!

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,349
Nope! Let's zoom in!

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,029
A fly has two wings.

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,112
Blink has wing cases on top!

5
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,000
So I'm a beetle!

6
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,497
Six legs? In you go!

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,474
Nice try, Fizz!

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,700
How many wings does a fly have?
